WEBVTT

00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:05.813
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:10.084
Todoke Message

00:00:10.488 --> 00:00:19.419
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.198 --> 00:00:20.698
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.698 --> 00:00:28.740
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.069
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.273 --> 00:00:36.475
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:40.978
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.085 --> 00:00:45.078
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.389 --> 00:00:49.485
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.061
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.397 --> 00:00:57.390
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.702 --> 00:01:01.468
Todoke Message

00:01:01.873 --> 00:01:10.042
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.481 --> 00:01:14.417
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:18.619
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:28.522
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:31.469 --> 00:01:35.200
At last, Shurei finally managed to
arrive in the city of Kinka...

00:01:35.373 --> 00:01:37.841
...where she promised she'd meet
up with Seiran and the others.

00:01:38.142 --> 00:01:41.134
But Kinka had become a stronghold
of the Murderous Blades.

00:01:42.046 --> 00:01:45.504
What's more, Shurei learned that
the Rin family had been killed...

00:01:45.783 --> 00:01:48.684
...by the Murderous Blades
a few days earlier.

00:01:50.788 --> 00:01:54.884
Then, who is that man?
Who in the world is he?

00:01:56.194 --> 00:02:01.154
Crows in a Moonless Night

00:02:03.634 --> 00:02:06.102
I wonder if they were
able to find the items.

00:02:09.874 --> 00:02:11.865
The governor's seal and charm.

00:02:19.283 --> 00:02:21.513
The governor's seal and charm
should get to Kinka...

00:02:21.586 --> 00:02:23.178
...about the same time you do.

00:02:24.222 --> 00:02:27.316
Even without more information, you'll
know them the instant you see them.

00:02:27.792 --> 00:02:29.692
I'll leave them
somewhere very safe...

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.387
...where no one will be
able to steal them.

00:02:31.963 --> 00:02:34.261
But where on earth is that?!

00:02:40.104 --> 00:02:42.072
He's wearing pears on his head.

00:02:42.807 --> 00:02:44.638
Ryuren?!

00:02:44.842 --> 00:02:46.810
Hi. Kindred spirit number one.

00:02:50.114 --> 00:02:52.082
What are you doing here!?

00:02:52.383 --> 00:02:54.476
I followed kindred spirit number two.

00:02:55.152 --> 00:02:58.212
Kindred spirit number
two... You mean Eigetsu?

00:03:01.058 --> 00:03:06.496
Kinka Castle? Eigetsu's been taken
into that castle? Can you save him?

00:03:07.365 --> 00:03:09.230
I'm guessing Ensei Ro
and Seiran Si...

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.427
...are headed to Kinka Castle
right about now.

00:03:15.039 --> 00:03:16.836
I have a gift for you.

00:03:18.042 --> 00:03:19.703
The charm and the governor's seal!

00:03:19.877 --> 00:03:22.243
I accepted it to bring to
the new governors as a gift.

00:03:24.081 --> 00:03:28.279
I get it now. Of course, nobody's gonna
want to deal with this eccentric...

00:03:28.686 --> 00:03:30.654
...so that's why they
couldn't be stolen.

00:03:31.322 --> 00:03:33.552
Please hand these
gifts over to Eigetsu.

00:03:33.624 --> 00:03:36.457
And also, before you head for Kinka
Castle, drop by the pawn broker.

00:03:36.894 --> 00:03:39.021
Something important should
have been delivered there.

00:03:40.131 --> 00:03:42.099
Aren't you going to come with me?

00:03:44.669 --> 00:03:49.038
Master... said he'll be waiting for
me at the Chrysanthemum Residence.

00:03:50.107 --> 00:03:52.098
So I must go there.

00:03:53.411 --> 00:03:55.311
Ryuren, would you happen to know?

00:03:56.647 --> 00:03:58.615
Who is that man?

00:03:59.984 --> 00:04:01.952
He's a man who knows everything.

00:04:02.586 --> 00:04:05.054
Was he behind the Rin
family being slaughtered?

00:04:05.523 --> 00:04:08.356
I'm sure you know the
answer to that.

00:04:11.162 --> 00:04:12.220
Are you going there?

00:04:13.464 --> 00:04:14.260
I am.

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:18.001
I salute you for your bravery.

00:04:23.374 --> 00:04:26.241
So you're a fake?
How dare you deceive me!

00:04:31.115 --> 00:04:32.514
What's so funny?

00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:34.551
Well, it just occurred to me...

00:04:34.618 --> 00:04:38.213
...that there happens to be someone
even less fortunate than these kids.

00:04:45.096 --> 00:04:47.530
Meisho! You bastard.
What's the meaning of this?

00:04:48.866 --> 00:04:53.360
You said to examine my future
prospects and serve you, Sojun.

00:04:53.738 --> 00:04:57.640
But unfortunately, there's no
comparison between you and him.

00:04:58.175 --> 00:05:00.143
Who are you talking about?!

00:05:01.412 --> 00:05:06.111
Our true employer is
someone you know very well.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.612
What?

00:05:07.685 --> 00:05:09.653
Apparently, the reason he
wants you killed now...

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.585
...is because he wants something.

00:05:12.056 --> 00:05:13.216
Something he wants?

00:05:13.858 --> 00:05:15.758
The position of the head
of the Sa Clan.

00:05:16.927 --> 00:05:21.091
Could the person who employed
you be... Damn it, that bastard!

00:05:25.369 --> 00:05:27.428
Close your eyes!

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:35.504
Leaving Seiran Si's treasured sword
at a pawn broker was a good idea.

00:05:36.147 --> 00:05:40.846
The Sa Clan would not think to check
pawned goods coming into Kinka.

00:05:50.127 --> 00:05:52.095
He was more trouble then I expected.

00:05:54.231 --> 00:05:55.323
Meisho!

00:05:58.002 --> 00:06:00.800
Honestly, you couldn't have made
your appearance at a better time.

00:06:03.541 --> 00:06:05.509
Who is your employer?

00:06:05.643 --> 00:06:10.273
Old man Chusho would not have killed
his precious grandson, Sojun! Tell me!

00:06:10.781 --> 00:06:12.908
How long do you intend
to stay on top of me?

00:06:12.983 --> 00:06:14.245
Ah, sorry!

00:06:14.318 --> 00:06:15.945
Boy, you're so rude.

00:06:18.856 --> 00:06:22.758
Little Whirlwind and Little
Rascal King. Drop your weapons.

00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:32.693
Don't lay a hand on Little Whirlwind.
Just kill Little Rascal King.

00:06:34.271 --> 00:06:35.966
Mr. Ensei.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:41.774
Don't worry. I'm your deputy officer.
It's only natural that I save you.

00:06:42.313 --> 00:06:45.214
You're not gonna tell me it's all
right not to save you, are you?

00:06:46.917 --> 00:06:48.885
I wouldn't say that.

00:06:48.986 --> 00:06:52.888
You get full marks for that answer.
Do a good job protecting Miss Korin.

00:06:53.424 --> 00:06:55.392
You idiot. Do you really
expect that you...

00:06:55.459 --> 00:06:58.917
...the Little Rascal King, can beat
us without your weapon? Get him!

00:07:01.799 --> 00:07:03.323
This is the Chrysanthemum
Residence.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.231
But the crest isn't the
chrysanthemum.

00:07:06.203 --> 00:07:09.070
It's been scratched out, with a new
one carved on top just recently.

00:07:10.074 --> 00:07:13.237
This is the Profusion of Peacocks,
the crest of the Sa Clan.

00:07:16.547 --> 00:07:18.515
Just as I feared, that man...!

00:07:21.585 --> 00:07:22.483
What?

00:07:22.553 --> 00:07:25.420
Didn't you know? Unarmed
fighting is Ensei's specialty.

00:07:28.392 --> 00:07:29.825
He only wields the staff to avoid...

00:07:29.894 --> 00:07:31.589
...injuring his opponent so badly with
his bare hands.

00:07:34.064 --> 00:07:37.693
To tell such an opponent to drop his
staff was suicide on your part, Meisho.

00:07:38.869 --> 00:07:41.099
Yo! Thank you for the compliment.

00:07:44.575 --> 00:07:46.634
Little Rascal King,
that's as far as you go!

00:07:46.777 --> 00:07:49.837
If you don't want them killed,
don't move another step!

00:07:56.287 --> 00:07:58.255
Mister Ryuren!

00:07:58.489 --> 00:08:00.957
I've come to save you,
kindred spirit number two.

00:08:01.659 --> 00:08:03.593
Th-Thank you very much.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.860
Kansho? What are you doing with this?

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:13.266
My other kindred spirit asked me to
do a favor. Finish them off quickly.

00:08:13.837 --> 00:08:16.533
At the Chrysanthemum
Residence, Shurei's in danger.

00:08:17.608 --> 00:08:19.576
Well, maybe.

00:08:23.948 --> 00:08:26.849
The Chrysanthemum Residence.
That's Great Uncle's...!

00:08:30.254 --> 00:08:32.222
Thank you very...!

00:08:35.859 --> 00:08:37.554
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:08:38.095 --> 00:08:39.892
You mean inside kindred
spirit number two...

00:08:39.964 --> 00:08:41.591
...there's a kindred spirit number 2. 5?

00:08:41.899 --> 00:08:43.799
He comes out when he
drinks alcohol.

00:08:44.268 --> 00:08:48.364
Now, come out! Kindred
spirit number 2.5!

00:08:54.845 --> 00:08:57.313
You're in my way. Outta
the way, stupid girl.

00:09:06.624 --> 00:09:09.752
So this is kindred spirit number 2.5.

00:09:10.694 --> 00:09:12.423
Damn you.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.298
Get up, Meisho!

00:09:18.702 --> 00:09:23.036
How foolish of you, Little Whirlwind.
You think you can win against me?

00:09:50.234 --> 00:09:52.202
Th-This can't be.

00:09:52.569 --> 00:09:54.298
Well, believe it.

00:09:54.371 --> 00:09:56.339
It was Seiran and me, just us two...

00:09:56.407 --> 00:09:59.001
...who destroyed the Murderous
Blades fourteen years ago.

00:09:59.543 --> 00:10:02.842
So why would you think the
likes of you could beat him?

00:10:04.481 --> 00:10:09.851
Is that a fact? But realize that
you're just being manipulated too!

00:10:10.554 --> 00:10:13.990
You, me, the Murderous Blades...

00:10:14.558 --> 00:10:16.753
...we're nothing but tools
used for his entertainment.

00:10:16.827 --> 00:10:18.317
What?

00:10:18.395 --> 00:10:22.263
Until now, he's never had any
interest in obtaining power...

00:10:23.067 --> 00:10:25.035
...so nobody ever realized it.

00:10:25.703 --> 00:10:27.671
But he ordered me
to kill his older brother.

00:10:30.374 --> 00:10:33.639
Soon, Sa Province will
become his toy.

00:10:38.449 --> 00:10:40.917
Kill his older brother?
That would mean...!

00:10:44.588 --> 00:10:46.556
Sojun's youngest brother?

00:10:47.257 --> 00:10:49.225
No, it's not Kokujun.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.728
In that case...!

00:10:52.596 --> 00:10:55.030
I'll direct you to the
Chrysanthemum Residence.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.660
Hey! Hurry up and go!

00:11:01.872 --> 00:11:03.897
We can pretty well handle things here.

00:11:06.009 --> 00:11:07.977
This way.

00:11:18.722 --> 00:11:21.156
Senya Rin. You can call me Senya.

00:11:25.028 --> 00:11:28.794
Rather than the young master of the
Rin family, I want you to see me.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.388
Hi, I'm glad to see you here.

00:11:54.124 --> 00:11:59.084
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:59.763 --> 00:12:02.391
Like I promised,
I've come to bid you farewell.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:06.360
A promise. I also asked
for a different promise.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.996
To have you tell me your real
name once we arrived in Kinka.

00:12:10.741 --> 00:12:14.643
If I tell you my real name, will you
please tell me your real name too?

00:12:15.646 --> 00:12:19.742
I'd be glad to tell you.
Since it's the name of your fiancé.

00:12:21.752 --> 00:12:23.720
It's Shurei Hong.

00:12:24.688 --> 00:12:27.486
Oh, I knew it. And it's
much better than Korin.

00:12:27.658 --> 00:12:31.321
It's beautiful, dignified,
and suits you well.

00:12:32.629 --> 00:12:34.597
You agree, don't you?

00:12:35.165 --> 00:12:37.133
And your name?

00:12:44.775 --> 00:12:46.606
Sakujun Sa.

00:12:56.887 --> 00:12:59.378
You know, I was quite
fond of the name Senya.

00:13:00.324 --> 00:13:02.087
It means a thousand nights.

00:13:02.159 --> 00:13:05.617
It's the perfect name for me, who was
born in the darkness of the new moon...

00:13:05.696 --> 00:13:09.132
...when the black moon that has
lost its light floats in the sky.

00:13:11.435 --> 00:13:12.834
You have a scary look on your face...

00:13:12.903 --> 00:13:15.201
...even though I asked you not
to act so coldly.

00:13:16.039 --> 00:13:18.530
I'm rather embarrassed
at my own foolishness.

00:13:19.209 --> 00:13:21.177
I never even suspected you...

00:13:21.278 --> 00:13:22.836
...and voluntarily fell right into the
grasp of the Sa Clan...

00:13:22.913 --> 00:13:24.107
...who have been targeting me.

00:13:27.317 --> 00:13:28.579
And you...

00:13:28.652 --> 00:13:31.917
You had everything planned from the
first moment we met at Sakyo, right?

00:13:33.857 --> 00:13:35.825
That's right.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.454
You've been walking a
rather dangerous tightrope.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.498
If you had made as much as
a minor error in judgment...

00:13:43.066 --> 00:13:46.365
...you would not have made it
to Kinka alive like this.

00:13:48.272 --> 00:13:51.241
I talked to you about this before.

00:13:51.308 --> 00:13:54.004
Once I find that special person,
I won't hesitate.

00:13:57.281 --> 00:14:02.947
You seem to have become that
special person. Despite that, you...!

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:06.848
Later, I'm going to make lots of tea for
the people who are important to me.

00:14:07.658 --> 00:14:09.182
I found that rather annoying.

00:14:09.259 --> 00:14:13.093
Because I want to keep the special
person I like all to myself.

00:14:14.565 --> 00:14:16.556
It's natural to think that way, right?

00:14:16.733 --> 00:14:20.601
That's why I needed my
brother Sojun to die.

00:14:21.939 --> 00:14:26.000
So I could become head of the Sa
Clan and welcome you as my wife.

00:14:31.214 --> 00:14:34.411
Because, to the Hong Clan
you're like a treasure.

00:14:35.819 --> 00:14:38.788
In order to face the
Hong Clan's fury head on...

00:14:39.222 --> 00:14:42.157
...I would have to at least
become head of the Sa Clan.

00:14:45.495 --> 00:14:49.056
Don't worry. I'll treat you
with great care. I'll be gentle.

00:14:50.167 --> 00:14:54.627
If I treat you as precious,
will you think of me as precious?

00:14:55.939 --> 00:14:57.964
Will you make Gan Lu tea for me, too?

00:14:59.109 --> 00:15:01.077
Will you stand by my side?

00:15:01.878 --> 00:15:03.846
I've never tried to be
liked by someone...

00:15:03.914 --> 00:15:06.644
...so I really don't know
how to go about it.

00:15:08.585 --> 00:15:13.579
Or, should I be whispering
"I love you" into your ear every night?

00:15:15.058 --> 00:15:18.027
Please don't forget. I love you.

00:15:20.897 --> 00:15:26.665
No. You... you don't love me.
That's not love.

00:15:27.604 --> 00:15:30.835
You're probably right.
I'm really not sure myself.

00:15:32.409 --> 00:15:36.709
It's just unusual for me to like
someone and want her by my side.

00:15:37.814 --> 00:15:40.442
If there are any obstacles keeping me
from achieving that, I'll eliminate them.

00:15:41.184 --> 00:15:43.618
If there's something I need,
then I shall get it.

00:15:44.321 --> 00:15:45.982
This is the first time in my life
I want to do something...

00:15:46.056 --> 00:15:48.286
for the sake of someone else.

00:15:49.459 --> 00:15:52.292
It doesn't really matter to me what
these feelings I have are called.

00:15:53.363 --> 00:15:55.854
Why do you like me so much?

00:15:57.601 --> 00:16:01.628
It's a mystery to me too. All I can say
is that when I'm with you, I feel good.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:07.706
If you become mine,
then I shall become yours, too.

00:16:08.478 --> 00:16:12.972
I will grant you any wish you have.
I will devote my life to you.

00:16:14.017 --> 00:16:18.920
Then, if I asked you to lock yourself
in a prison, would you do it?

00:16:19.923 --> 00:16:24.951
Sure. If the prison is you, then I'd
happily be bound to it with chains.

00:16:26.329 --> 00:16:27.296
Although it would come with...

00:16:27.364 --> 00:16:29.958
...the condition of you being
bound to me too...

00:16:30.701 --> 00:16:32.669
...and entertaining only me.

00:16:32.969 --> 00:16:35.563
And if you became bored of
me, then you'd escape prison.

00:16:35.939 --> 00:16:38.908
You'd break out of
your cell... and kill me.

00:16:40.877 --> 00:16:42.902
Are people's lives
nothing to you but toys...

00:16:42.979 --> 00:16:45.106
...to give you something
to do when you're bored?

00:16:45.716 --> 00:16:49.948
That's right. I'm not even interested
in my own mortality or path in life.

00:16:51.054 --> 00:16:53.522
That's why I have no choice but
to look for it in other people.

00:16:54.124 --> 00:16:58.322
However... Humans will break
after a little play.

00:16:59.162 --> 00:17:00.823
But you're strong.

00:17:00.897 --> 00:17:04.389
I don't imagine you'll ever break or
choose death under any circumstance.

00:17:05.302 --> 00:17:08.703
That's why I'm able to play
with you without worry.

00:17:09.306 --> 00:17:13.299
Don't mock me! I don't have the
time to be playing with you!

00:17:16.146 --> 00:17:18.614
Well, it appears that the person
you're waiting for has arrived.

00:17:18.915 --> 00:17:20.883
You knew that, and still...!

00:17:21.318 --> 00:17:24.481
I told you. I will grant
you any wish you have.

00:17:25.055 --> 00:17:28.991
But since you're not mine yet,
this is it for now.

00:17:30.026 --> 00:17:32.995
This is a little present...

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:35.664
...for you, for having played
the erhu for me every night.

00:17:51.414 --> 00:17:53.609
How shall I address you?

00:17:54.017 --> 00:17:56.417
Little Whirlwind? Or Your Highness?

00:17:58.622 --> 00:18:00.749
You've become rather
short-tempered.

00:18:01.925 --> 00:18:03.950
You're quite fascinating, as always.

00:18:04.127 --> 00:18:06.561
While you're here,
let me tell you something.

00:18:07.297 --> 00:18:10.960
Little Whirlwind.
Fourteen years ago...

00:18:11.601 --> 00:18:14.035
...that time you had
collapsed in the snow...

00:18:14.104 --> 00:18:18.097
...I was the one who found you and
took you to the Murderous Blades.

00:18:20.477 --> 00:18:23.969
I believed you had plenty of potential.
It was kind of me, don't you think?

00:18:24.548 --> 00:18:27.073
Seiran, calm down!
Don't fall into that guy's trap!

00:18:29.252 --> 00:18:32.085
Seiran... You mustn't... Seiran.

00:18:33.423 --> 00:18:35.357
Officer Si. You have my permission.

00:18:35.425 --> 00:18:37.859
Accomplish your objective
for coming here.

00:18:38.862 --> 00:18:40.830
I'll make Gan Lu tea for you later!

00:18:42.766 --> 00:18:44.393
My Lady.

00:18:49.639 --> 00:18:51.266
Sakujun Sa!

00:18:51.341 --> 00:18:52.330
By the power of Kansho...

00:18:52.409 --> 00:18:55.310
...bestowed upon me by the King
of Saiunkoku, Ryuki Shi...

00:18:55.812 --> 00:18:57.746
...as well as the order
of my superior...

00:18:57.814 --> 00:18:59.145
...I shall arrest you for
your Involvement...

00:18:59.216 --> 00:19:00.410
...with the Murderous Blades!

00:19:04.454 --> 00:19:06.888
Unfortunately, you have
nothing to charge me with.

00:19:06.957 --> 00:19:08.515
What did you say, you bastard?!

00:19:08.592 --> 00:19:10.025
The crimes were committed
by my grandfather...

00:19:10.093 --> 00:19:11.958
...elder brother, and
the Murderous Blades.

00:19:12.028 --> 00:19:14.656
All I did was bring a girl
to Kinka at her request.

00:19:15.498 --> 00:19:19.366
Might I add safely,
and without a scratch?

00:19:21.638 --> 00:19:24.106
Right? I haven't done
anything wrong, have I?

00:19:24.341 --> 00:19:25.569
You bastard!

00:19:25.642 --> 00:19:27.200
I heard from Kokujun...

00:19:27.277 --> 00:19:30.212
...that this residence originally
belonged to old man Enjun!

00:19:30.714 --> 00:19:32.511
And yet you...

00:19:32.582 --> 00:19:34.846
Can't you tell the Chrysanthemum
Residence is weeping?!

00:19:35.552 --> 00:19:40.285
My Great Uncle... I went through some
rough times, all because of that man.

00:19:40.924 --> 00:19:43.688
Well, I did eventually get
my revenge against him.

00:19:44.127 --> 00:19:46.095
You didn't...!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.198
Great Uncle?! No, Kokujun.

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:56.703
Nine years ago, Aunt
and Uncle were killed.

00:19:57.674 --> 00:19:59.505
You're talking about Advisor
Sa's son and his wife.

00:19:59.576 --> 00:20:01.601
The one who killed
Shunki's parents...

00:20:07.284 --> 00:20:09.013
...is you, brother Sakujun!

00:20:09.085 --> 00:20:11.053
I don't like you all that much either.

00:20:12.022 --> 00:20:15.753
You're a nuisance because you
resemble Great Uncle Enjun the most.

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:19.058
Well then, I should be on my way.

00:20:19.996 --> 00:20:23.193
Since it appears that you
won't be able to arrest me.

00:20:25.769 --> 00:20:29.637
Come. To Koren, the capital of Sa
Province. I'll be waiting for you.

00:20:30.941 --> 00:20:35.810
And please don't forget that I love you.
Even if you don't accept my love.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:39.913
Please don't forget. I love you.

00:20:40.684 --> 00:20:44.085
Next time we meet.
Call me by my real name.

00:20:45.121 --> 00:20:47.919
I want to hear my name
spoken with your lovely voice.

00:20:48.658 --> 00:20:50.592
From now on, call me by my name!

00:20:52.062 --> 00:20:54.622
No. It's not the same.

00:20:55.865 --> 00:20:57.628
I'll be waiting for you.

00:20:57.701 --> 00:20:59.066
I won't go!

00:21:00.136 --> 00:21:03.128
You'll come. You'll definitely
come to see me.

00:21:05.241 --> 00:21:07.209
As long as I have this flower hairpin.

00:21:11.181 --> 00:21:14.708
The bud. The king is a clever man.

00:21:18.888 --> 00:21:19.786
Oh, that's right.

00:21:19.856 --> 00:21:24.225
Grandfather Chusho is having a
new head of Sa Clan ring made.

00:21:24.928 --> 00:21:26.896
Without conferring with the clan?

00:21:27.464 --> 00:21:29.432
It's meaningless to
hold a consultation...

00:21:29.499 --> 00:21:32.127
...at a time when everyone's
fighting for one seat.

00:21:33.036 --> 00:21:37.598
Yet, no one will acknowledge any
arbitrarily-made clan leader ring.

00:21:38.241 --> 00:21:41.005
That's why we needed
the new governor.

00:21:42.212 --> 00:21:43.975
The government official is the
king's representative here.

00:21:44.047 --> 00:21:46.242
Therefore, if designated by
the provincial governor...

00:21:46.316 --> 00:21:49.012
...there's no choice but to acknowledge
that person as the new head of the clan.

00:21:49.085 --> 00:21:53.021
That's why grandfather wanted
the governor's charm and seal...

00:21:53.757 --> 00:21:57.022
...so that he could appoint a governor
who would act according to his will.

00:22:18.882 --> 00:22:20.850
Crows in a moonless night.

00:22:22.118 --> 00:22:24.985
Governor Hong, are you all right?

00:22:28.558 --> 00:22:30.526
Sai, my dear old man!

00:22:32.128 --> 00:22:34.460
This is Lord Shin Sai,
the Mayor of Kinka.

00:22:36.766 --> 00:22:39.234
Did the Merchants Guild
act on our behalf?

00:22:42.205 --> 00:22:45.572
By the order of the Mayor of Kinka,
capture the Murderous Blades!

00:22:45.842 --> 00:22:47.810
Don't let any of them escape!

00:22:48.044 --> 00:22:51.912
Lord Shin Sai, you are the
Mayor of Kinka, are you not?

00:22:52.449 --> 00:22:54.417
Kinka is an important city.

00:22:54.617 --> 00:22:56.414
I would like not to waste
a moment in...

00:22:56.486 --> 00:22:58.977
settling and stabilizing the
situation here.

00:23:00.023 --> 00:23:02.389
I would appreciate it if you could
kindly give me some guidance...!

00:23:05.095 --> 00:23:07.063
My Lady!

00:23:17.173 --> 00:23:19.073
Shurei.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:35.717
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.925 --> 00:23:42.262
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.565 --> 00:23:47.525
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.737 --> 00:23:52.834
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.843 --> 00:23:58.246
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.782 --> 00:24:04.913
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.688 --> 00:24:16.257
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.133 --> 00:24:22.730
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.139 --> 00:24:28.202
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.078 --> 00:24:34.641
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:35.018 --> 00:24:41.821
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.128 --> 00:24:45.528
Next Episode

00:24:45.528 --> 00:24:47.764
Next Episode
Seiran, Ensei, Eigetsu...

00:24:47.764 --> 00:24:47.797
Next Episode

00:24:47.797 --> 00:24:50.366
Next Episode
The Prettier the Flower,
the Higher the Branch
...Korin, I'm so glad you're all safe!

00:24:50.366 --> 00:24:50.400
Next Episode
The Prettier the Flower,
the Higher the Branch

00:24:50.400 --> 00:24:52.869
Next Episode
The Prettier the Flower,
the Higher the Branch
It's so reassuring that
we're together again!

00:24:52.869 --> 00:24:53.403
Next Episode
The Prettier the Flower,
the Higher the Branch

00:24:53.403 --> 00:24:54.437
Next Episode
The Prettier the Flower,
the Higher the Branch
No matter what lies ahead,
as long as we work together...

00:24:54.437 --> 00:24:55.734
No matter what lies ahead,
as long as we work together...

00:24:55.805 --> 00:24:57.204
...we can overcome anything!
